[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: Scheduled typed stack and bound RAM aliases

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: CIL-TYPE-001
TITLE: Validate intermediate stack categories before lowering
STATEMENT: >>>
Validate reachable evaluation-stack categories and every declared argument/local
index before allocating hardware. Reject integer/reference confusion in numeric,
return, conversion, storage and memory operands, including same-height incompatible
control-flow merges. Preserve bounded native array-length category until explicit
conv.i4/u4 normalization. Include original method and IL-offset diagnostics.
Do not claim general CLI verification or native-integer arithmetic support.
Verification: ScheduledTypedStackTests and existing scheduled compiler regression.
<<<
